notes.content:
Deep Enigma's bugs fixes!

Patch note:

- Difficulty reduced, at the request of the community;
- Improved AI for some enemies;
- Added tutorials in computer logs;
- fixed a bug, when sometimes, the Dragon Boss became immortal;
- fixed a bug, when sometimes, doors closed over the player;
- fixed some sprite bugs;
- fixed a secret room, when teleport skill won't work correctly.
